# default-nodes.list — custom nodes every spark-comfyui-cluster install gets,
# baked into the image and reconciled on every container start together with
# your own comfyui-nodes.list (same format, same installer). Fork-owned: edit
# it here, in the repo, and an 'update' ships the change to every Spark.
#
# Installed when missing and otherwise left alone, so updating a node from
# ComfyUI Manager sticks and a restart never downgrades it.
# SPARK_DEFAULT_NODES=0 skips this list.

https://github.com/roadmaus/ComfyUI-Continuity
